{"product_id":"dragon-s-shadow-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Dragon’s Shadow – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Elite Cue","description":"\u003cp\u003eDark, powerful, and unmistakably distinctive, the \u003cstrong\u003eDragon’s Shadow\u003c\/strong\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue inspired by the strength, mystery, and legendary presence of the dragon. Built from \u003cstrong\u003epremium palm wood\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue showcases dramatic natural grain patterns that give every section a unique character, depth, and organic beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe rich palm wood is enhanced by a sleek \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-gloss black finish\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a sophisticated foundation for the centerpiece of the design—the \u003cstrong\u003edragon-inspired handcrafted abalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e incorporated into the grip. Carefully shaped from shimmering abalone, the intricate inlay work captures the flowing form and spirit of a dragon, revealing flashes of natural color and brilliance as the cue moves under the light.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComplementing the organic character of the palm wood is elegant \u003cstrong\u003eblack and white decorative ringwork\u003c\/strong\u003e, adding clean definition and visual balance throughout the cue. The precision \u003cstrong\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/strong\u003e completes the construction, providing a solid and secure connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Dragon’s Shadow is a striking expression of craftsmanship where \u003cstrong\u003enatural palm wood, polished black detailing, and handcrafted abalone artistry\u003c\/strong\u003e come together in one distinctive design. Because every piece of palm wood carries its own unique grain pattern, each cue possesses a character that is truly its own.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Palm Wood\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dragon-Inspired Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGrip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Palm Wood with Dragon-Inspired Abalone Inlay Design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-Gloss Black Finish\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRingwork:\u003c\/strong\u003e Custom Black \u0026amp; White Decorative Rings\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBrand:\u003c\/strong\u003e Elite Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDark elegance. Natural character. Legendary craftsmanship. A cue designed to make a statement before the first shot is played.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🐉🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484548726832,"sku":null,"price":35000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/78910.png?v=1786598344","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\/dragon-s-shadow-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","provider":"Elite Cue","version":"1.0","type":"link"}